"Circle of Runes"
"The cave-like surroundings are lit up with an eerie glow emanating from a
circle of runes engraved into the stone floor.  The walls and ceiling are
rough with jagged edges protruding out at odd angles, whilst the floor however
is completely flat and smooth, except fo the runes.  Upon the northern wall
appears an outline of a doorway, but no means of opening the mysterious door
are clearly visible.
"
